[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H$ tambo init --guided < answers.txt\r\nprofile [kg/retrieval/code-intel/crew/everything]: what should \r\nthis installation help you do? how many themed crew members \r\nshould be configured? how many ontology questions must the \r\nfinished graph answer? (press enter to use the built-in self-test\r\n question) using the built-in self-test question; add your own \r\nlater by editing the plan's [intent]\r\nplan: caboodle-plan.toml\r\n"]
[7.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H$ python3 review-plan.py\r\nProfile: kg\r\nWould install: quipu, camayoc\r\nPurpose: Explore a local knowledge graph\r\nQuestion: does the knowledge store answer a query about a fact \r\nwritten to it?\r\nReview the full caboodle-plan.toml before applying.\r\n"]
[14.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H$ tambo verify\r\nhook bundle NOT verified: `st` (shantytown) is not installed on \r\nthis host, so no hook bundle is registered here\r\nquipu: verified\r\ncamayoc: verified\r\n"]
